"On Windows on ARM, the OpenGL that Spotifast X draws with comes from "
"Microsoft's OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Open its Microsoft "
"Store page to install or repair it?"
msgstr ""
"W systemie Windows na ARM OpenGL, którego Spotifast X używa do rysowania, "
"pochodzi z pakietu OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack firmy "
"Microsoft. Otworzyć jego stronę w Microsoft Store, aby go zainstalować lub "
"naprawić?"

#. Translators: Keep {url} exactly as written. It becomes the address
